#### From mathcomp Require Import all_ssreflect all_algebra. From mathcomp Require Import reals geometry. Set Implicit Arguments. Unset Strict Implicit. Unset Printing Implicit Defensive. Section Equilateral_AFG_BED_problem. Variable R : realType. Variables A B C D E F G : 'rV[R]_2. Hypothesis H_eq_triangle : distance A B = 840 /\ distance B C = 840 /\ distance C A = 840 /\ ~~ collinear [:: A; B; C]. Hypothesis H_D_on_side : exists l : 'rV[R]_2 -> bool, (forall P, l P = ([<P;1>] = [<B;1>])) /\ orthogonal (B - D) (C - B) /\ D \notin [::A;B;C] /\ (exists h, D = B + h *: perp (C - B) /\ 0 < h). Hypothesis H_line_l : forall P, collinear [:: D; B; C] -> (exists k, P = D + k *: (C - B)). Theorem triangle_parallel_intersection : exists area : R, area > 0. Proof. Admitted. End
